
1.The Library contains a collection of Books. If the library building burns down (Library object destroyed), the books in the system's database are also deleted.(Composition)

2. The library has Librarians who work there. If the library closes down, the librarians do not disappear; they can get jobs elsewhere.(Aggregation)

3. A Librarian needs to print a search report. They temporarily use a ReportPrinter helper class for this.(Dependency)

4. The system has a NotificationService interface. The library can use either EmailAlert or SMSAlert concrete implementations to remind members of overdue books.(Realization)


